    </div>

    <!-- QUESTION 2: Doctor Loyalty -->
    <div id="mdh-q2" class="mdh-q-card" style="display:none;">
      <h3 class="mdh-q-title">2. Do you have specific doctors or specialists you would be upset to lose access to?</h3>
      <p class="mdh-q-desc">Some seniors have trusted specialists for chronic care, while others are comfortable picking from an approved network directory.</p>
      <div class="mdh-btn-grid">
        <button type="button" class="mdh-choice-btn" data-q="2" data-val="yes">
          <span class="mdh-choice-title">Yes, keeping my exact doctors is essential</span>
